{"id": "86226", "name": "צמצום שבר אלגברי בשני משתנים – גורם a משותף (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Reduce the following fraction to its lowest terms:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Take out the common factor of the numerator and of the denominator, then cancel it.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Factorise the numerator and the denominator</b><br>Every term of the numerator and every term of the denominator contains <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> (the lowest power of <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> in them is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a^1\\)</span>), so take it out of both. By factorising the numerator and the denominator we obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Cancel</b><br>Then we can cancel the \\({{CT:3}}\\) from the numerator and denominator (we assume \\(a\\neq 0\\)) to obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}}. \\]</p>Nothing else cancels: the bracket in the numerator is not a factor of the denominator (substituting <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a={{CT:5}}b\\)</span> in the denominator's bracket does not give <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span>).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You need to express your answer as a single fraction.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "lowesttermsp(ans)", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You need to cancel common factors in the numerator and denominator.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["cf1", "cf2", "cf3", "d", "n", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}